data: {"id": "fde24db8882f48a4-thinking-parallel_evidence-782", "run_id": "fde24db8882f48a4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 调查结论 (aiops-case-v06/workload)\n\n### 已采集事实\n1.  **Pod 生命周期**：Pod `workload` 处于 `Pending` 阶段，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `ContainerCreating`。Pod 被调度到 `node2`。\n2.  **Prometheus 指标**：确认 `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending(1)`，`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=ContainerCreating(1)`，重启次数为 0。\n3.  **核心根因证据 (Events)**：\n    *   `Warning FailedMount` (x35): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory`。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789130054725, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

